# INDEX: DIAGNOSTIC

## Required

1. `project-rules/rules/operational_rules.md`

## On trigger

- `architecture_rules.md`: the symptom indicates a structural or layer violation.
- `domain_rules.md`: the symptom is in contract, mapping, or serialization.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: the symptom is in an error flow.
- `auth_rules.md`: the symptom is in access, session, or permission.
- `security_rules.md`: the symptom involves secrets, PII, or environment.
- `ui_rules.md`: the symptom is in presentation or interaction.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `api_contract_reference.md`: suspected divergence from an external contract.
- `project-rules/contracts/*.openapi.json`: divergence from the REST contract — consult-only.
- Omit this section when there is no actionable reference.
